{"about_the_game":"A set of additional scenarios for &quot;NOBUNAGA'S AMBITION: Awakening.&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis set consists of 6 scenarios, with 3 historical scenarios including &quot;Birth of Nobunaga,&quot; the scenario with the earliest possible starting point in the game, and 3 fictional scenarios including &quot;Absence of Great Conflict,&quot; the scenario about how history would have played out if the Onin War had not occurred. In addition, the scenario &quot;Battle of Nagashino,&quot; which was released as a bonus for the Asian version for the game, and the early purchase bonus &quot;Battle of Tetorigawa&quot; have been added to this set as bonus content.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Additional Scenarios<br />\r\n&quot;Birth of Nobunaga&quot;<br />\r\n&quot;Fateful Clash&quot;<br />\r\n&quot;Kyushu Conquest&quot;<br />\r\n&quot;Absence of Great Conflict&quot;<br />\r\n&quot;Tenbun Upheaval&quot;<br />\r\n&quot;Widespread Might&quot;<br />\r\n&quot;Battle of Nagashino&quot; (bonus for Asian version)<br />\r\n&quot;Battle of Tetorigawa&quot; (early purchase bonus)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- How to Access<br />\r\nSelect New Game and then choose the desired scenario on the scenario selection screen to play.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3311490?t=1749085216","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3311490?t=1749085216","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311490/c987a4fdca8b7b568b1ee9f93da8c43b77cdecc1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749085216","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3311490/c987a4fdca8b7b568b1ee9f93da8c43b77cdecc1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749085216","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":